Package: PSSDplusplus
Type: Package
Title: Probabilistic Microplastic Ecotoxicity Workflow (PSSD++)
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Scott", "Coffin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com"),
    person("Contributors", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Provides the probabilistic ecotoxicity workflow used in the ToMEx 2.0
    microplastic risk assessment under the PSSD++ banner. The package bundles
    the Monte Carlo alignment functions, probabilistic species sensitivity
    distribution (PSSD++) engine, plotting helpers, and the preprocessed ToMEx
    2.0 ecotoxicity dataset to reproduce the analysis shown in the repository
    reprex script.
